  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 56
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "A new day dawned over the city of Griffin's Rock . Through the window
    sounds of the city could be heard, the merchants harking there wares, The farmers
    driving the animals through the city, The guls in the harbour, all this and more
    added to the conofiphny of sound that was life in the big city. Arising and dressing
    you hastily grab a apple as you notice the time , your supervisor will not appreciate
    you being late for work on this day. \n\nLeaving your home in the artisans quarter
    you take a moment admire your surroundings high on the hill over looking the
    city the Palace of (name here) Duke of the Isle, who's family has ruled here
    for generations, The temple of (religion name here) who's followers will soon
    be flocking into it to celebrate the day of (name) and below the harbour busy
    with fishermen and traders. Whistling and nameless tune and smiling you head
    to the merchants quarter and to (name of company)."
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 1980409970}
